# Allowlist — only ship what the Go build needs into the build context.
# Everything else (gitignored secrets, build artefacts, docs, IDE files,
# .git history) stays on the host. Fails closed: new top-level paths
# must be added here before they can enter any image.
*
!cmd/
!internal/
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Belt: even inside allowlisted dirs, never let secrets through. Catches
# stray .env / direnv / *.secret files dropped under cmd/ or internal/.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.secret
**/*.secrets
**/secrets.*
**/.envrc
